+---
+schema: forkmesh-pull-v1
+number: 37
+title: Make an agent session always deletable
+base: main
+head: agent/adhoc-49-make-it-so-that-an-agent-session-can-always-be-d
+status: open
+ts: 1782518821616
+author: 7ZMh_2s_IOTPiKoZ6K5eDe4AclTYh_JzqJ7pK2lovT4
+authorName: dev-2f782c1c
